<p>Returns the cosine of an angle.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Float%20keyword" title="Float keyword">float</a> cos(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Float%20keyword" title="Float keyword">float</a> fValue<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">fValue<dd>The angle in radians
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
